{"id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-polish-space.md","title":"Polish Space","display":"df-polish-space — Polish Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-polish-space","aliases":["58-df-polish-space","Polish Space","58-df-zfc-metric-polish-space","58-df-zfc-top4-polish-space","58-df-zfc-top7-polish-space"],"display":"df-polish-space — Polish Space","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-polish-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-polish-space</span><span>Polish Space</span><span>58-df-zfc-metric-polish-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-top4-polish-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-top7-polish-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polish-space — Polish Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b964f54c2e6e909d\" href=\"?note=b964f54c2e6e909d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md\">../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05d80cd20b53d8a2\" href=\"?note=05d80cd20b53d8a2\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md\">../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-metric.md\">../batch18/58-df-metric.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,d\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span>（拓扑空间谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（度量谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-metric.md\">../batch18/58-df-metric.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本原子定义的度量诱导拓扑谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)\\)</span>（完备度量谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"05d80cd20b53d8a2\" href=\"?note=05d80cd20b53d8a2\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md\">../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeparableMetric}_S(X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{SeparableMetric}_S(X,d)\\)</span>（可分度量谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b964f54c2e6e909d\" href=\"?note=b964f54c2e6e909d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md\">../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（此处定义的 Polish 空间谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricPolishSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PolishSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7PolishSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricPolishSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PolishSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7PolishSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（兼容别名）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induces\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\n\\land\n\\tau=\n\\left\\{\nU\\subseteq X:\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)&lt;r\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induces\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\n\\land\n\\tau=\n\\left\\{\nU\\subseteq X:\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)&lt;r\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists d\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{SeparableMetric}_S(X,d)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists d\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{SeparableMetric}_S(X,d)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}metric\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricPolishSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}metric\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricPolishSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}top4\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4PolishSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}top4\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4PolishSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}top7\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7PolishSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}top7\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7PolishSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Polish: separable complete metric space</li>\n<li>“诱导同一拓扑”现由开球刻画展开；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是谓词参数，因此不会把定义在其他载体上的度量误配给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Polish spaces are second countable and Hausdorff; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{C}^n\\)</span>, and compact metric spaces are standard examples.</li>\n<li>Polish groups: topological groups with Polish topology</li>\n<li>Borel hierarchy: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0\\)</span> Borel sets</li>\n<li>Standard Borel: Polish with Borel structure</li>\n<li>Baire 空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^\\omega\">\\(\\mathbb R^\\omega\\)</span> 也是 Polish，但不应把两者当作同一命名对象。</li>\n<li>Cantor 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 与配备上确界范数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C([0,1])\">\\(C([0,1])\\)</span> 也是标准 Polish 空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kechris, Classical Descriptive Set Theory</li>\n<li>Becker and Kechris, Polish Group Actions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"b964f54c2e6e909d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"05d80cd20b53d8a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2$（度量谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"05d80cd20b53d8a2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)$（完备度量谓词，见 [[../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"b964f54c2e6e909d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeparableMetric}_S(X,d)$（可分度量谓词，见 [[../batch05/58-df-separable-metric.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeparableMetric}_S(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricPolishSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PolishSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7PolishSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}induces\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\n\\land\n\\tau=\n\\left\\{\nU\\subseteq X:\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)<r\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists d\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{SeparableMetric}_S(X,d)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polish\\text{-}space\\text{-}metric\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricPolishSpace}